GENERATED DATA (the data/ directory)

  data/gamedict.json   — a parsed snapshot of Zwift's public GameDictionary.xml
  data/portal-roads.json — a parsed snapshot of Zwift's public PortalRoadSchedule
  data/route-achievements.json — a route→achievement mapping DERIVED from the above

The gamedict and portal-roads snapshots are factual game data generated from
Zwift's publicly served game assets; that underlying data is Zwift, Inc.'s and is
included here only to let the tool run offline. It is regenerable at any time
with `npm run refresh`. No ownership of Zwift's data is claimed.

